From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:42:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 245/248] CG (4655): each person's message carries only their
 own part, ON
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Misho's yes, 13 Oct 11:2x UTC in the operations chat („ჩემგან ყველაფერზე
კია", relayed verbatim by ops at 11:28Z). 0229 shipped the split and the
own-part check behind OWN_PART_ONLY_ON=false until his yes on the refusal
sentence (OTHER_PART_REFUSAL in ownPart.ts, unchanged). The switch is now
true. Setting it back to false restores the earlier guard.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
---
 .../__tests__/eachPersonGetsOnlyTheirOwnPart.test.ts         | 4 ++--
 src/services/introInstruction.ts                             | 5 +++--
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/services/__tests__/eachPersonGetsOnlyTheirOwnPart.test.ts b/src/services/__tests__/eachPersonGetsOnlyTheirOwnPart.test.ts
index 0c27744..ade458b 100644
--- a/src/services/__tests__/eachPersonGetsOnlyTheirOwnPart.test.ts
+++ b/src/services/__tests__/eachPersonGetsOnlyTheirOwnPart.test.ts
@@ -11,8 +11,8 @@ const GELA = 'გელა გამოგონილი';
 const LEVAN = 'ლევან საცდელი';
 
 describe('each person gets only their own part (4655)', () => {
-  it('ships OFF: with the split off, the guard behaves as main does now', () => {
-    expect(OWN_PART_ONLY_ON).toBe(false);
+  it('is ON since Misho’s yes (CG, §139); with the split off, the guard behaves as before', () => {
+    expect(OWN_PART_ONLY_ON).toBe(true);
     expect(askIsTheIntroduction(OWNER, GELA, false)).toBe(true);
     expect(questionCarriesAnotherPart(OWNER, GELA, 'და ლევანმა გააცნოს ნინო', false)).toBe(false);
   });
diff --git a/src/services/introInstruction.ts b/src/services/introInstruction.ts
index f20f995..bf4f461 100644
--- a/src/services/introInstruction.ts
+++ b/src/services/introInstruction.ts
@@ -49,9 +49,10 @@ function nameStem(name: string): string | null {
  * Gela's part is a question — but 0226 split it alone and Gela's one message
  * then carried Levan's introduction too, so it was reverted. The split now
  * comes only together with the own-part check (ownPart.ts), behind one switch:
- * OFF until Misho's yes on that check's refusal sentence.
+ * ON since Misho's yes on that check's refusal sentence (CG), 13 Oct 11:2x UTC
+ * in the operations chat, „ჩემგან ყველაფერზე კია" (§139).
  */
-export const OWN_PART_ONLY_ON = false;
+export const OWN_PART_ONLY_ON = true;
 const PART_BREAK_RE = /;\s*|,\s*(?:და|ასევე|and|also)\s+/iu;
 
 /** The owner's words cut into each person's part (sentences, and parts when split). */
